## Fonts
cask "font-fira-code"
cask "font-monaspace"
cask "font-symbols-only-nerd-font"
cask "font-jetbrains-mono-nerd-font"  # v3 Nerd Font, since Rio + NvChad devicons need v3 glyphs
cask "font-hack"   # plain Hack
cask "font-noto-emoji"
# "Hack Nerd Font Mono" is the family .config/ghostty/config and
# .config/rio/config.toml actually name, and font-hack above does not provide it
# (it ships only Hack-Regular/Bold/Italic). The faces currently resolve from
# hand-installed files in ~/Library/Fonts named "Hack * Nerd Font Complete*.ttf",
# which is Nerd Font v2 naming that v3 dropped. So a fresh box gets no Nerd Hack
# at all, and this box has only v2 glyph coverage. Declared for reproducibility,
# but not installed here yet, because adding v3 faces beside the v2 files would
# register two fonts claiming the same family name. Remove the v2 files first,
# then `brew install --cask font-hack-nerd-font`.
cask "font-hack-nerd-font"
# More Nerd Font variants.
cask "font-fira-code-nerd-font"
cask "font-fira-mono-nerd-font"
cask "font-roboto-mono-nerd-font"
cask "font-sauce-code-pro-nerd-font"


